        "replo_text_1924ef89-dc98-4e1b-bf0b-a1c5f689860b": "<p>Mandy G</p>",
        "replo_text_2144ed75-914d-4d6b-8543-66053e249cca": "<p>Daughter-Recommended</p>",
        "replo_text_a3d3b79c-3733-4765-a215-57bbc5a554d3": "<p>Wasn’t sure I’d like the style, but once I tried it on, I was amazed. The support and lift made me feel great in my swimsuit: something I hadn’t felt in years!</p>",
