    "benefit_accordion_iw_exHaY6": {
      "type": "benefit-accordion-iw",
      "blocks": {
        "benefit_m8VCNV": {
          "type": "benefit",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Which Push-Up Bra Insert style is right for me?",
            "content": "<p>Both styles offer amazing lift and support but cater to different preferences. The <a href=\"https://www.honeycloudz.com/products/triangle-push-up-bra-inserts\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">Push Up Triangle </span></a>has a tapered shape and will fit well into halter-style swimsuits, triangle bikini tops, slimmer bralettes, or top styles. While the <a href=\"https://www.honeycloudz.com/products/ovals-push-up-bra-inserts\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">Push Up Oval </span></a>provides an even more dramatic and rounded appearance. The ovals push up is exceptional for bras.</p>"
          }
        },
        "benefit_6TxFpj": {
          "type": "benefit",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Will these inserts work in any bra?",
            "content": "<p>Our Push-Up Bra Inserts are designed to fit comfortably in most regular bras, and pocketed bras. In addition to bras, they also <a href=\"https://www.honeycloudz.com/collections/swimsuit-inserts\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">work well in swimsuits </span></a>and bra alternatives such as <a href=\"https://www.honeycloudz.com/collections/honey-cloudz-inserts-for-sports-bras\" title=\"https://www.honeycloudz.com/collections/inserts-for-sports-bras\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">sports bras</span></a>, bralettes, dresses, shelf camisoles.</p>"
          }
        },
        "benefit_a8j3KW": {
          "type": "benefit",
          "settings": {
            "title": "How long do Push-Up Bra Inserts typically last?",
            "content": "<p>The lifespan of your inserts depends on wear frequency and washing. Generally, they should be replaced on average every 6 months, or if they lose their shape / you see the push up effect begin to lessen. </p>"
          }
        },
        "benefit_UX4LqH": {
          "type": "benefit",
          "settings": {
            "title": "How do I wash my Push-Up Bra Inserts?",
            "content": "<p>Both <a href=\"https://www.honeycloudz.com/collections/honey-cloudz-triangle-bra-insert-collection\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">Triangle </span></a>and <a href=\"https://www.honeycloudz.com/collections/ovals\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">Oval inserts </span></a>are machine or hand washable. For best results, place them in <a href=\"https://www.honeycloudz.com/collections/all/products/travel-wash-mesh-bag\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">a mesh laundry bag </span></a>and follow the care instructions provided on the product page to ensure proper cleaning and maintain their shape.</p>"
          }
        },
        "benefit_jjyx7q": {
          "type": "benefit",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Can I wear these Push Up Inserts without a pocket?",
            "content": "<p>Yes! Because of the exterior grips, they can be worn inside bralettes, swimsuits, dresses, and camisoles as long as they are fitted and have a seam or elastic bust. They are not a stick-on bra and must be worn inside clothing.</p>"
          }
        },
        "benefit_nh3DCC": {
          "type": "benefit",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Do I need to have something for them to fit and work?",
            "content": "<p>Yes for these 2 styles you do need to have some breast tissue to be able to push it up. If you don't have much of a breast profile but want some breast definition or shaping we recommend our <a href=\"https://honey-cloudz.myshopify.com/collections/honey-cloudz-plus-bra-inserts-collection\" title=\"Honey Cloudz Plus+ Bra Inserts Collection\"><strong>Plus Collection.</strong></a></p>"
          }
        }
      },
